## Problem classes

### `Build fails after a table edit`

| Symptom | Cause | Fix |
| ------- | ----- | --- |
| Missing getters on the database class | `database.g.dart` is stale | Run `dart run build_runner build`. Commit the generated file with the table change. |

<!-- last-verified: 2026-10 -->

### `Passphrase visible in the sqlite file`

| Symptom | Cause | Fix |
| ------- | ----- | --- |
| A Wi-Fi password shows up under `settings` or a text column | Caller invoked `SecretStore.write` without checking `usesSecureStorage`; insecure stores persist into Drift | Gate before `write`. If secure storage is missing, keep the attempt value in memory and skip `write`. Never add a passphrase column. |

